<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>KARACHI, March 7 - Twelve vessels waiting off port, including 1 sugar discharger waiting two days, six fertiliser vessels, the first waiting 48 days, and four oil tankers, the first waiting six days.</p>
</text>
